WEBVTT

00:01.610 --> 00:04.620
<i>I hate demons because they're deceitful.</i>

00:04.620 --> 00:07.310
<i>I hate spirits because they're creepy.</i>

00:07.730 --> 00:10.170
<i>I hate mythical beasts 
because they're barbaric.</i>

00:10.740 --> 00:13.260
<i>I hate celestials because they're stubborn.</i>

00:14.570 --> 00:18.030
<i>I hate humans because they're weak.</i>

00:20.190 --> 00:25.360
<i>And I hate myself the most 
because I'm made of all of those things.</i>

00:26.670 --> 00:31.500
<i>But Kai... He was the only one 
who wasn't afraid of me,</i>

00:31.500 --> 00:34.270
<i>who didn't hate me, who embraced me.</i>

00:35.670 --> 00:38.880
<i>Kai, don't die on me, okay?</i>

00:51.320 --> 00:55.860
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

02:16.490 --> 02:19.470
Putting all of our efforts together, 
the Urza Federation Rebel Army is heading

02:19.470 --> 02:22.280
towards the government palace 
via the underground passage to strike.

02:22.690 --> 02:26.000
While the main forces 
keep the demons occupied,

02:26.000 --> 02:29.040
we'll free the captives 
from the basement and defeat Vanessa.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.970
Jeanne-sama is the one commanding, after all.

02:31.970 --> 02:34.550
I believe it will succeed.

02:34.550 --> 02:38.420
The only thing I'm worried 
about in this plan is...

02:39.300 --> 02:42.970
That <i>we're</i> the assault 
team to defeat Vanessa!

02:42.970 --> 02:46.730
I can't believe it! What are they expecting 
us to do with just the four of us?!

02:46.730 --> 02:50.520
Like I said, it's to get 
to Vanessa as quickly as we can.

02:50.520 --> 02:53.480
I know that, but why am I part of it?!

02:53.870 --> 02:57.860
The only people I can trust to be 
our backup are you and Ashran.

02:57.860 --> 02:59.960
I understand that, too...

02:59.960 --> 03:02.120
But some things are just scary, okay?!

03:04.610 --> 03:05.910
Feel better?

03:07.230 --> 03:09.120
Yeah... Thanks.

03:09.750 --> 03:12.880
You're Kai's friend, so you're special.

03:13.720 --> 03:16.930
Don't worry, Saki. I'm strong.

03:16.930 --> 03:19.460
I probably won't lose to anyone but Vanessa.

03:19.460 --> 03:21.020
What? And if it is Vanessa...?

03:23.210 --> 03:24.720
What's with that silence?!

03:25.070 --> 03:26.210
Don't worry.

03:26.210 --> 03:29.570
If I have to, I'll self-destruct 
and take Vanessa out with me.

03:29.570 --> 03:30.560
Don't jump the gun!

03:31.410 --> 03:33.770
I'm worried, too.

03:33.770 --> 03:36.780
We don't know what kind of state 
the government palace is in,

03:36.780 --> 03:41.380
and won't the demons spot us, 
moving in large groups like we are?

03:41.380 --> 03:45.050
They won't. Demons are sensitive to magic,

03:45.050 --> 03:46.780
but humans don't have magic abilities.

03:47.420 --> 03:49.750
So it should be harder for them to notice us.

03:50.070 --> 03:53.160
Is that another thing you learned 
from the world you're from?

03:53.160 --> 03:54.720
That makes me feel better, at least.

03:55.160 --> 03:56.710
You're very calm, Ashran.

03:57.090 --> 03:58.520
What are you talking about?

03:58.520 --> 04:00.420
My hands have been shaking this whole time.

04:00.950 --> 04:03.780
But you know, if we do manage 
to defeat the demons,

04:03.780 --> 04:06.180
we'll be the talk of the world.

04:06.820 --> 04:10.140
We'll be praised, and may even be 
handsomely rewarded, you know?

04:10.690 --> 04:13.960
You're more reliable than the Ashran I know.

04:13.960 --> 04:15.850
What's that mean? Are you complimenting me?

04:16.450 --> 04:17.820
I'm counting on you.

04:22.810 --> 04:27.250
To all my comrades of the Urza 
Federation Rebel Army gathered here.

04:27.250 --> 04:29.990
I commend your trust 
in joining me at this place.

04:30.780 --> 04:35.870
There is no doubt that your loyalty 
and bravery are the hope for humanity.

04:36.250 --> 04:38.940
I'm sure some of you may be concerned

04:38.940 --> 04:40.920
due to the short preparation 
time for this operation.

04:41.390 --> 04:43.230
But I want you to remember...

04:43.490 --> 04:46.140
Just how many years have 
we been fighting?

04:46.760 --> 04:51.130
Looking back, we've fought back 
against the rule of the mighty demons

04:51.130 --> 04:54.490
for longer than anyone can remember!

04:54.490 --> 04:56.900
That's how long we've been fighting.

04:57.290 --> 05:02.230
It has all been preparation 
for <i>this</i> very day.

05:02.690 --> 05:07.150
For too long have we merely nurtured 
our spirit and will to fight!

05:07.530 --> 05:09.540
It's time we made our voices heard!

05:09.990 --> 05:11.380
The time has come to strike back!

05:11.870 --> 05:15.180
Everyone, let us crawl out 
of this dark basement!

05:17.080 --> 05:18.210
Let's go!

05:30.760 --> 05:31.970
Is <i>this</i>...

05:32.490 --> 05:34.520
the government palace?!

05:37.870 --> 05:39.100
Humans!

05:41.650 --> 05:43.590
Freeze!

05:44.070 --> 05:45.940
I know that magic.

05:48.690 --> 05:50.120
You...!

05:56.940 --> 05:57.870
Kai, above you!

06:07.490 --> 06:08.840
Let's get rid of them in one shot.

06:11.840 --> 06:13.270
Bolt Bullet!

06:20.250 --> 06:21.480
Was that you, too?

06:21.780 --> 06:25.900
Yeah, it's a bullet manufactured 
in my world to combat groups.

06:25.900 --> 06:29.110
I can't believe it. It's too amazing.

06:29.110 --> 06:30.370
Can you sense it, Rinne?

06:30.370 --> 06:31.160
Yeah.

06:33.350 --> 06:34.120
Over there!

06:36.040 --> 06:39.010
Jeanne, I'm going to look for Vanessa.

06:39.010 --> 06:40.950
I'll start on the top floor on the north side.

06:41.880 --> 06:44.440
The elevator and the central 
stairs are too exposed.

06:44.440 --> 06:45.710
How about the emergency stairs?

06:45.710 --> 06:49.070
The ones on the north side are collapsed. 
You could use the south side.

06:49.070 --> 06:49.720
I see.

06:50.130 --> 06:51.580
Then from the south to the north,

06:51.580 --> 06:54.120
we'll have to break 
through ten flights of stairs.

06:54.680 --> 06:56.600
Here are the group assignments!

06:57.490 --> 07:00.690
Group one, do not let any demons 
into the government palace!

07:01.110 --> 07:03.730
Group two, quickly rescue 
the prisoners underground!

07:04.280 --> 07:07.190
We'll be heading up the emergency 
stairs on the south side!

07:08.090 --> 07:12.340
That attack from earlier... it's quite powerful 
for such a wide-area thunder attack.

07:12.340 --> 07:14.910
Yeah, it's my best bullet.

07:15.380 --> 07:17.210
Even though you didn't pull the trigger?

07:18.130 --> 07:20.140
You couldn't have fired a bullet like that.

07:21.060 --> 07:24.040
I felt a strange presence 
from the start, but...

07:24.040 --> 07:26.630
Kai said he would challenge 
Vanessa one-on-one.

07:27.140 --> 07:28.960
You won't go back on your word, will you?

07:29.990 --> 07:30.800
No.

07:31.320 --> 07:32.380
Let's hurry.

07:33.030 --> 07:35.120
The demons should be gathering soon.

07:39.060 --> 07:40.520
Kai, over there!

07:40.520 --> 07:41.940
An imp!

07:41.940 --> 07:44.270
He's summoning a large demon!

07:47.840 --> 07:48.360
It's coming!

08:00.910 --> 08:01.370
Too slow.

08:07.550 --> 08:08.750
Humans!

08:09.220 --> 08:11.330
Jeanne-sama, go on above!

08:11.330 --> 08:12.010
Falin!

08:12.470 --> 08:13.810
It's a mere doll, useless.

08:13.810 --> 08:15.390
I'll quickly get rid of it and catch up.

08:15.900 --> 08:16.880
Do not worry.

08:18.420 --> 08:19.390
I'll wait at the top.

08:34.990 --> 08:36.410
I'm heading in!

08:38.420 --> 08:39.790
That's strong magic!

08:42.830 --> 08:43.910
Jeanne?!

08:49.830 --> 08:52.380
There's no need to worry about me.

08:52.670 --> 08:55.680
This magic... An elven garment?!

08:55.680 --> 08:59.490
Precisely. It's a magic item 
known as the "Sacred Light Garment,"

08:59.490 --> 09:01.010
which we seized from an elf village.

09:01.420 --> 09:03.980
When it comes to magical 
resistance, nothing is better.

09:05.010 --> 09:07.100
We'll take it from here.

09:07.850 --> 09:08.910
You go on ahead.

09:10.390 --> 09:13.440
Were you not the one who 
said you'd defeat Vanessa, Kai?

09:13.890 --> 09:16.480
Yeah, I'll make sure of it.

09:22.570 --> 09:24.160
Now, come, demon!

09:24.680 --> 09:26.630
The Knight of the Sacred Light will face you!

09:30.580 --> 09:34.170
You're sure this will keep the 
demons from seeing us?

09:34.170 --> 09:35.760
How does it work?

09:35.760 --> 09:37.840
I used barrier magic—

09:37.840 --> 09:38.800
Rinne!

09:38.800 --> 09:43.140
I mean, a human made it, mimicking 
an angel's barrier magic!

09:43.540 --> 09:47.300
That's right. It refracts 
light and hides you.

09:47.300 --> 09:50.040
Make sure you stay close 
to Rinne and me, you two.

09:58.990 --> 10:00.520
Shh.

10:23.580 --> 10:25.440
It worked, didn't it?

10:25.440 --> 10:27.850
That almost scared me to death...

10:31.490 --> 10:33.290
I'm counting on you guys.

10:33.290 --> 10:35.790
Yep, either you defeat Vanessa,

10:35.790 --> 10:40.160
or, if that's looking impossible, we cut 
the breakers to turn off all the lights.

10:40.550 --> 10:43.930
Yeah, and we'll make our escape in the dark.

10:43.930 --> 10:45.410
I'll send a signal to time it.

10:45.850 --> 10:47.660
You two wait here.

10:47.660 --> 10:51.170
If you stay quiet, I don't think 
any demons should come.

10:51.170 --> 10:53.000
Okay, be safe.

10:53.000 --> 10:54.420
Don't push yourselves too much.

11:00.860 --> 11:02.840
An alarm? Did they find us?!

11:02.840 --> 11:05.470
No way! My barriers should be working!

11:05.880 --> 11:07.630
They shouldn't be able to see us.

11:08.680 --> 11:11.020
Could it be the building's infrared sensors?!

11:14.520 --> 11:18.780
I see these human "machine" things 
do come in handy sometimes.

11:20.800 --> 11:22.610
What are those wings?

11:23.220 --> 11:26.360
Such a chaotic and ugly sight to behold.

11:27.400 --> 11:29.820
Since you like talking 
so much, answer me this.

11:29.820 --> 11:32.710
Was it you who kept maintenance 
of the surveillance system?

11:33.370 --> 11:35.590
It was Empress Vanessa's wisdom.

11:36.030 --> 11:39.620
"These human surveillance systems are superb."

11:39.620 --> 11:41.550
"By all means, let us utilize them," she said.

11:42.170 --> 11:44.760
And letting slaves maintain them 
means no hassle for us.

11:45.130 --> 11:49.260
Her majesty was very pleased 
by your invasion.

11:49.260 --> 11:54.230
She is curious to know why you took this 
opportunity to commit such a suicidal act.

11:54.740 --> 11:57.730
Then can you guide us to Vanessa?

11:58.110 --> 12:01.030
I see a chance for my own enjoyment.

12:01.930 --> 12:04.490
There's no reason why I should miss out.

12:04.490 --> 12:05.990
Is that so?!

12:07.410 --> 12:08.620
Rinne?!

12:12.800 --> 12:13.840
Go!

12:17.250 --> 12:18.430
Rinne?!

12:19.080 --> 12:20.290
Don't worry.

12:20.290 --> 12:21.720
You go on ahead, Kai.

12:21.720 --> 12:22.590
But!

12:23.210 --> 12:25.420
I'll be right behind you.

12:27.640 --> 12:29.680
You'd better catch up to me.

12:29.680 --> 12:31.350
That's a promise!

12:35.340 --> 12:37.940
I smell it. The smell of an angel.

12:37.940 --> 12:40.430
But I smell demon as well?

12:40.430 --> 12:43.880
An elf's smell and a dwarf's smell as well.

12:43.880 --> 12:46.700
A dragon, too. And a spirit smell as well.

12:47.300 --> 12:49.500
Just what are you?

12:50.150 --> 12:53.410
Even I don't know.

12:56.300 --> 12:58.590
All I do know...

12:59.260 --> 13:01.760
is that I hate you guys!

13:02.630 --> 13:05.130
I want to stay with Kai.

13:05.130 --> 13:08.800
If you're going to interfere, then I 
don't care what happens to you!

13:22.010 --> 13:24.570
Welcome, human.

13:25.770 --> 13:29.220
Dark Empress... Vanessa.

13:32.490 --> 13:34.000
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

13:35.500 --> 13:37.000
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

13:42.420 --> 13:44.260
You insignificant human!

13:48.840 --> 13:50.100
So weak!

13:51.560 --> 13:53.930
But then, you're only human...

13:59.980 --> 14:02.940
The armor? No, underneath it.

14:03.310 --> 14:04.900
An elven garment!

14:05.660 --> 14:06.740
Unlock form!

14:11.150 --> 14:12.620
Longbow of the Moon,

14:12.620 --> 14:13.490
pierce through!

14:20.910 --> 14:24.420
Elven and angelic magic items, huh?

14:24.870 --> 14:29.180
If used by a human incapable of magic,
 they'll chip away at your life force.

14:30.040 --> 14:33.660
You've chosen death, then. How foolish.

14:36.120 --> 14:41.490
I've chosen death, you say? 
That's exactly right.

14:41.490 --> 14:46.360
A human needs at least that 
much resolve to defeat a demon!

14:46.780 --> 14:51.410
This is nothing compared to fighting 
against the hero of the demons...

14:51.410 --> 14:52.490
Jeanne-sama!

15:01.780 --> 15:04.250
Sorry to have kept you waiting, my lord.

15:04.590 --> 15:06.400
You gave me the chills.

15:07.870 --> 15:09.510
I've heard of it...

15:09.880 --> 15:15.720
A human called "Dragonar," 
who fights with a drake fang as a weapon.

15:16.240 --> 15:17.890
It's you, isn't it?

15:17.890 --> 15:18.680
Who knows?

15:19.240 --> 15:21.540
Our subordinates are holding the line,

15:21.540 --> 15:23.940
but there's still a limit to 
how much time they can buy us.

15:23.940 --> 15:25.860
It all depends on 
the situation on the top floor.

15:29.850 --> 15:31.880
You're not going to throw away your gun?

15:31.880 --> 15:32.990
What did you say?

15:33.290 --> 15:38.650
Any human would be surprised to learn 
that the strongest demon is a succubus.

15:38.650 --> 15:41.750
I don't mind making love to you 
to pass the time.

15:42.170 --> 15:43.410
Absolutely not.

15:43.410 --> 15:45.590
What you really love is slaughter.

15:49.010 --> 15:51.340
My, you're interesting!

15:51.340 --> 15:56.680
And here I was thinking of making a mere 
human like you my slave with one charm,

15:57.150 --> 15:59.910
but I wasn't expecting that reaction.

16:00.180 --> 16:03.080
Speaking of which, I heard 
that there's a commander

16:03.080 --> 16:06.750
who uses an elven garment 
within the Human Rebel Army.

16:06.750 --> 16:08.080
Is that you?

16:08.080 --> 16:10.360
No. I'm an outsider.

16:10.750 --> 16:13.510
I came from a world 
where history claims your defeat.

16:15.030 --> 16:17.390
Unfortunately for you, 
such a world does not exist.

16:17.390 --> 16:20.360
It never has, and never will.

16:20.360 --> 16:22.880
Whether you believe it or not,

16:22.880 --> 16:25.710
I'm a human who ended up in 
this world against my will.

16:26.280 --> 16:28.220
The history I remember is the one

16:28.220 --> 16:30.410
where the Great War 
of the Five Races is long past.

16:31.350 --> 16:34.750
Then, which race was it that defeated me?

16:34.750 --> 16:35.430
Humans.

16:36.830 --> 16:37.980
Humans?

16:44.980 --> 16:48.980
Not the mythical beasts, 
nor the celestials, nor the spirits...

16:48.980 --> 16:51.130
The <i>humans</i> won?

16:51.130 --> 16:52.610
How hilarious.

16:52.610 --> 16:55.910
And just who in the world 
was it that defeated me?

16:56.950 --> 16:58.410
Prophet Sid.

16:59.650 --> 17:00.980
Sid...

17:02.580 --> 17:03.740
Sid?

17:04.180 --> 17:05.790
Human... Sword...

17:06.230 --> 17:10.240
Sid... Graveyard... Code Holder... Seal...

17:11.070 --> 17:12.380
World Reincarnation...

17:13.090 --> 17:14.640
What did you just say?!

17:14.950 --> 17:15.840
Nothing.

17:16.270 --> 17:19.680
For one such as myself to waste time 
on such trivial matters...

17:20.220 --> 17:22.930
Well, it was quite fun while it lasted.

17:26.060 --> 17:27.270
Turn to dust.

17:29.310 --> 17:30.190
Counteract.

17:31.230 --> 17:31.980
What?!

17:32.450 --> 17:34.820
You're taking humans too lightly, demon!

17:37.100 --> 17:38.050
An illusion?!

17:38.050 --> 17:40.530
First time experiencing 
a succubus's illusions?

17:43.390 --> 17:46.540
That's a good reaction. And that weapon...

17:47.000 --> 17:52.200
It counteracts my magic and unleashes 
an attack similar to that of a drake's breath.

17:52.200 --> 17:54.910
That weapon must be that 
of your world, I take it?

17:54.910 --> 17:56.630
Are you ready to believe me?

17:56.630 --> 17:59.090
Don't be full of yourself, 
insignificant human!

18:03.680 --> 18:04.930
Gloria.

18:04.930 --> 18:07.230
Let thy purgatory have flames!

18:17.100 --> 18:18.990
Damn it.

18:18.990 --> 18:22.660
I kept the flames focused to keep from 
destroying my fortress, but I went too far...

18:23.010 --> 18:24.900
Now, what's your next move?

18:24.900 --> 18:28.290
I'm using a blasting technique 
that can destroy any race!

18:32.060 --> 18:34.750
Gloria, thy paradise.

18:35.010 --> 18:36.550
Explosion Chaos!

18:40.790 --> 18:41.760
Kai.

18:47.420 --> 18:49.480
Did that come from above?

18:53.550 --> 18:57.400
There is no way to escape death 
from that shot,

18:57.790 --> 19:00.710
unless one is a hero from the four races.

19:01.990 --> 19:05.260
And yet, how is it you still live?

19:07.370 --> 19:11.500
<i>I was saved again by Sid's sword.</i>

19:11.880 --> 19:14.760
Human, what is that sword?

19:15.270 --> 19:16.420
Beats me.

19:16.800 --> 19:17.960
Kai, stand back!

19:21.980 --> 19:23.950
Hey, those wounds...

19:24.800 --> 19:27.840
I'm fine. I did push myself a little, though.

19:27.840 --> 19:29.710
I'm glad you're alive.

19:30.150 --> 19:32.720
You pushed yourself way more than "a little"...

19:32.720 --> 19:35.920
I felt the building shake hard,

19:35.920 --> 19:38.550
and got scared that you might be dead.

19:38.970 --> 19:40.440
So I won't forgive you!

19:40.440 --> 19:41.570
Come at me, Vanessa!

19:41.940 --> 19:43.920
I'll face you!

19:44.800 --> 19:46.330
What are you?

19:59.140 --> 20:03.220
Observing unexpected fluctuations 
from the hero of the demons.

20:03.630 --> 20:07.140
Influence from the taboo word "Sid."

20:09.660 --> 20:13.090
Initiating excision by Last Riser.

20:13.090 --> 20:14.440
You're...?!

20:14.760 --> 20:18.020
Potential to influence world 
determined "diffusible."

20:18.430 --> 20:21.800
You... I see...

20:21.800 --> 20:24.750
I understand now, Last Riser!

20:24.750 --> 20:26.490
Executing zero code.

20:27.350 --> 20:31.330
Removing Hero Vanessa's code from the world.

20:34.710 --> 20:37.340
Gloria, sequentia!

20:37.810 --> 20:41.340
Bless thy blood, body, and spirit!

20:42.460 --> 20:46.140
Don't get cocky, you trash!

20:46.910 --> 20:50.100
Increased resistance from 
Dark Empress Vanessa?

20:50.440 --> 20:55.270
Did a mere dog of Alfreya 
arrogantly think it could take my head?

20:55.270 --> 21:00.150
Unexpected magic, zero code completion in...

21:01.770 --> 21:02.940
Scatter.

21:14.410 --> 21:17.960
Still won't die even after that, huh?
What an eyesore.

21:18.630 --> 21:21.610
Damage tolerance exceeded.

21:27.950 --> 21:30.830
So this is the hero of the demons...

21:32.010 --> 21:35.630
Rinne, you were fighting someone like her?

21:36.510 --> 21:37.650
No.

21:38.460 --> 21:39.580
I'm scared.

21:40.180 --> 21:42.160
She was always strong, but...

21:42.690 --> 21:47.110
The Vanessa from my old world 
wasn't this scary!

21:47.710 --> 21:49.820
What is this injury?

21:49.820 --> 21:52.250
It won't heal even when 
I focus my magic on it.

21:52.730 --> 21:53.660
Whatever.

21:55.550 --> 22:00.650
Right now, getting rid of the weaklings 
before me takes priority.

22:05.050 --> 22:09.970
<b>Episode 3
"The Hero of the Demons"</b>

23:36.510 --> 23:41.050
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?
